Thanks for the suggestion. I'm new to this, so if I understand what you're saying, I added the parameterization to the SEM fit command:

fit <- sem(model.numcc, data = data_final, estimator="WLSMV", ordered=TRUE, parallel = "multicore", parameterization = "theta")

Though from the documentation it looked like delta was default, I tried that as well and both returned the same matrix of all zeros unfortunately.

Tom

